    "rules": {
      "amount": "The large amount is myAmountMinor (money) when the server returned it, with the deposited line under it; absent or empty: no amount and no deposited line.",
      "headline": "ineligible: notEligible (\"仅 {name} 可领取\" with designatedName, else the generic notEligible copy). eligible and completed: missed. eligible and expired or refunded: expired. Everyone else: none (the greeting stands).",
      "summary": "ineligible, or eligible and expired / refunded: none. Otherwise: completed with totalMinor and completedAtMs: summaryCompleted {shares, totalMoney, duration = completedAtMs - createdAtMs}. Otherwise with both totalMinor and claimedMinor: summarySender {claimed, shares, claimedMoney, totalMoney}. Otherwise: summaryCount {claimed, shares}. Only the sender ever receives totals, so the others get the count line.",
      "claims": "The claim list shows exactly when claimsListed is true (the server decides who may see it); each row is name, time, money of its amountMinor, and the best-luck tag the server set.",
      "note": "sender and open with expiresAtMs: refundAt {time of expiresAtMs}. sender, expired or refunded, with refundedMinor > 0: refundedNote {money, time of refundedAtMs (time part omitted when absent)}. Otherwise none.",
